subckt pseudo_r a b
    MPA (mid mid a a) pmos1 w=WPR l=LPR ad=WPR*0.6u as=WPR*0.6u pd=2*WPR+1.2u ps=2*WPR+1.2u
    MPB (mid mid b b) pmos1 w=WPR l=LPR ad=WPR*0.6u as=WPR*0.6u pd=2*WPR+1.2u ps=2*WPR+1.2u
ends pseudo_r
subckt lna_v2 vinp vinn vref vout vdd vss iref
    CIN1 (vinp ninv) mimcap area=WCIN*LCIN1 perim=2*WCIN+2*LCIN1
    CIN2 (vinn nnon) mimcap area=WCIN*WCIN perim=4*WCIN
    CF1 (vfb ninv) mimcap area=WCF*WCF perim=4*WCF
    CF2 (nnon vref) mimcap area=WCF*WCF perim=4*WCF
    PR1_0 (vfb pr1_m1) pseudo_r
    PR1_1 (pr1_m1 pr1_m2) pseudo_r
    PR1_2 (pr1_m2 pr1_m3) pseudo_r
    PR1_3 (pr1_m3 pr1_m4) pseudo_r
    PR1_4 (pr1_m4 pr1_m5) pseudo_r
    PR1_5 (pr1_m5 ninv) pseudo_r
    PR2_0 (nnon pr2_m1) pseudo_r
    PR2_1 (pr2_m1 pr2_m2) pseudo_r
    PR2_2 (pr2_m2 pr2_m3) pseudo_r
    PR2_3 (pr2_m3 pr2_m4) pseudo_r
    PR2_4 (pr2_m4 pr2_m5) pseudo_r
    PR2_5 (pr2_m5 vref) pseudo_r
    IPRB (vout vfb) iprobe
    I0 (nnon ninv vout vdd vss iref) ota_fc_lna_v2
ends lna_v2
subckt lna_chop vinp vinn vref vout vdd vss iref c1 c1b c2 c2b o1 o1b o2 o2b
    CIN1 (vinp ninv) mimcap area=WCIN*LCIN1 perim=2*WCIN+2*LCIN1
    CIN2 (vinn nnon) mimcap area=WCIN*WCIN perim=4*WCIN
    CF1 (vfb ninv) mimcap area=WCF*WCF perim=4*WCF
    CF2 (nnon vref) mimcap area=WCF*WCF perim=4*WCF
    PR1_0 (vfb pr1_m1) pseudo_r
    PR1_1 (pr1_m1 pr1_m2) pseudo_r
    PR1_2 (pr1_m2 pr1_m3) pseudo_r
    PR1_3 (pr1_m3 pr1_m4) pseudo_r
    PR1_4 (pr1_m4 pr1_m5) pseudo_r
    PR1_5 (pr1_m5 ninv) pseudo_r
    PR2_0 (nnon pr2_m1) pseudo_r
    PR2_1 (pr2_m1 pr2_m2) pseudo_r
    PR2_2 (pr2_m2 pr2_m3) pseudo_r
    PR2_3 (pr2_m3 pr2_m4) pseudo_r
    PR2_4 (pr2_m4 pr2_m5) pseudo_r
    PR2_5 (pr2_m5 vref) pseudo_r
    IPRB (vout vfb) iprobe
    I0 (nnon ninv vout vdd vss iref c1 c1b c2 c2b o1 o1b o2 o2b) ota_fc_chop
ends lna_chop
Vc1 (c1 0) vsource dc=VDD
Vc1b (c1b 0) vsource dc=0
Vc2 (c2 0) vsource dc=0
Vc2b (c2b 0) vsource dc=VDD
Vo1 (o1 0) vsource dc=VDD
Vo1b (o1b 0) vsource dc=0
Vo2 (o2 0) vsource dc=0
Vo2b (o2b 0) vsource dc=VDD
VDD (vdd 0) vsource dc=VDD
IREF (vdd iref1) isource dc=IREF
VREF (vref 0) vsource dc=VREF
VIP (vinp 0) vsource type=sine dc=VCM+VOS sinedc=VCM+VOS ampl=AMP/2 freq=FSIG mag=0.5 pacmag=0.5
VIN (vinn 0) vsource type=sine dc=VCM sinedc=VCM ampl=AMP/2 freq=FSIG sinephase=180 mag=0.5 phase=180 pacmag=0.5 pacphase=180
CL (vout 0) capacitor c=CL
I1 (vinp vinn vref vout vdd 0 iref1 c1 c1b c2 c2b o1 o1b o2 o2b) lna_chop
save vout I1.ninv I1.nnon I1.I0.g1 I1.I0.g2 I1.I0.f1 I1.I0.f2 I1.I0.s5 I1.I0.s6 c1 c2 o1 o2 VDD:p
save I1.I0.M1:cgg I1.I0.M1:gm I1.I0.M1:ids I1.I0.M1:cgs
op dc
